<title>MEXICO: Autrey gets green light for Drogueros buy.</title>
<headline>Autrey gets green light for Drogueros buy.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican pharamaceutical chain Grupo Autrey said in a statement released on Monday the monopolies commission had approved its acquisition of Drogueros SA de CV, the fourth largest chain in Mexico.</p>
<p>Autrey said in a statement that authorization was recived &quot;with no limitations or conditions&quot; and that the company expected the deal to be completed by the last week in August.</p>
<p>(( --Martin Roberts, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7907))</p>
